                                "sense_id": "873cf0c4-c043-352d-a408-796a41ac1937",
                                "text": "By the time a letter from Marcy finally came, explaining that the entire time she had been living on the South Side in a Negro neighborhood near the university, and that she had a son whom she'd named Tatum Kubiac—\"Tatum\" after a famous jazz pianist—it seemed to make little difference."
