                                "sense_id": "da00974b-8ff4-37ad-89fc-6b3bc5a76381",
                                "text": "The youngest ever Oscar-winner is an actress called Tatum O'Neal, who was ten when she won Best Supporting Act for the film Paper Moon (1973)."
